[[3,63,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing and refitting\nthe pretensioners, observe all the specified safety regulations\n(\n                                                         <a href=\"#/2892271\">7065</a>\n                                                          ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892219\">7045A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891667\">3380A44</a>\n                                           (left only)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892200\">7040H34</a></p><p>1. Remove the clip (1a) and withdraw the through stud (1b).</p><p>2. Undo the bolt.</p><p>3. Remove the seat belt with pretensioner (3a).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>When the centring pin (3b) is\nwithdrawn from its seating, the pretensioner is automatically disarmed.\nDo not tamper with the centring pin.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035866.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>Place the pretensioner in the\nspecial cabinet, resting it on a free surface.</p>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Handle the pretensioner with extreme\ncare, without tampering with the centring pin.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>1. Refit the pretensioner (1a) checking that the centring pin is\npositioned correctly (1b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>When the centring pin is positioned\ncorrectly in its seating, the pretensioner is automatically armed.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>2. Tighten the bolt to the specified torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not use impact tools for tightening.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT SEAT BELT PRETENSIONER.</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Fit the through stud and fit the clip.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035867.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2892200\">7040H34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891667\">3380A44</a>\n                                           (left only)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892219\">7045A10</a></p>"]]